AkinVox Kokoro Cloning v1
Copyright 2026 AkinVox

This distribution includes inference components adapted from StyleTTS 2
by Aaron (Yinghao) Li (MIT), including its iSTFTNet integration, and uses
Kokoro by hexgrad (Apache-2.0). Modifications include the inference-only
reference mapper, LoRA loading and switching, asset verification, and CLI/demo.
Original notices are retained in licenses/ and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

Kokoro and WavLM model weights are fetched separately from their pinned
upstream repositories. Third-party software and weights retain their licenses.

